# Haru's earthbend 1 comes with the return clause ("When it dies or is exiled, return it to the battlefield tapped"): Bot1's
# Forest is earthbent twice (a 2/2 land creature) by Invasion Reinforcements and its Ally token, then Bot2's Go for the Throat
# destroys it. The delayed trigger Haru's earthbend created returns it tapped as a plain land again, no longer a creature (CR 701.66a,
# 603.7, 400.7).

[Bot1 Deck]
Forest
Mox Pearl
Black Lotus
Haru, Hidden Talent
Invasion Reinforcements
Forest x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Black Lotus
Go for the Throat
Swamp x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Haru, Hidden Talent.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Invasion Reinforcements.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Black)
Bot2.Hand.Go for the Throat.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Forest)
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Types = Land
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Power = (absent)
Bot2.Graveyard = Go for the Throat; Black Lotus
